 "body": "This addresses issue #1981 and (partly) #3054: Currently AWT initializes the GUI code and thus needs to have a GUI present. This breaks command line builds on headless linux system. This patch adds a section \"BUGS\" to  the manual page with a simple workaround. I decided to use \"BUGS\" since CLI mode should require no Xserver and no X11 libraries in the best case. \n",
